WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:01.543
Mike, please don’t leave me here, bro.

00:00:01.543 --> 00:00:02.877
Tellus, you’re retired.

00:00:02.877 --> 00:00:04.587
It’s not safe for you to be on your own.

00:00:04.587 --> 00:00:05.672
I’m a year younger than you.

00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:06.673
I’ll come visit...

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:08.383
Maybe during my bye week.

00:00:08.383 --> 00:00:10.051
That’s not till Week 9...

00:00:10.051 --> 00:00:11.428
Brothers never visit.

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:15.223
So it’s pretty neat here.

00:00:15.223 --> 00:00:17.559
You can help the retired Cowboys call bingo games.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.644
Ok, so based on this formation...

00:00:19.644 --> 00:00:22.188
I’m guessing the next ball will be N24.

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:23.148
What he said!

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:24.566
Um...hey, Witt.

00:00:24.566 --> 00:00:25.275
Oh...

00:00:25.275 --> 00:00:26.151
It’s Marty.

00:00:26.443 --> 00:00:28.278
When I moved into the retirement home...

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:29.946
crime dropped 100 percent!

00:00:29.946 --> 00:00:32.115
Here we see our exercise programs.

00:00:32.115 --> 00:00:33.825
My in-season record is 25,000...

00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:35.035
but I think I can beat that now!

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.953
I’m sure Canada will call soon, T.O.!

00:00:36.953 --> 00:00:38.580
They still think they can play...

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:40.123
This place sucks.

00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:41.750
I gotta get the f--k out of here.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:43.376
Martellus, you’re 31.

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:45.545
There’s nothing out there for you anymore.

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:46.212
One of us... One of us...

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:48.089
I survived a 28-3 deficit—

00:00:48.089 --> 00:00:49.841
I’m not going out like this!

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:53.553
Cutty, I need help!

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:54.220
Cigarette?

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.264
There we go miscommunicating again.

00:00:56.264 --> 00:00:57.015
AHHHHHH!!

00:00:57.015 --> 00:00:59.976
♪ Retired Athletes Have No Life. ♪

